<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοητ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>witchcraft, jugglery</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. καὶ μαγεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				203a
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ὑγιές, ἀλλὰ γ. τις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					584a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Andronic.
			</span></i> Rhod.<i><span class="en">
				p.573
			</span></i> M., etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάτη καὶ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.20.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. τῆς ὑποκρίσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.76
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονῆς δι᾽ ὀμμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.961d
				</span></i>
			: in a milder sense, '<i>finesse</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				9.13.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῆς φύσεως γ.</span> the
				<i>magic</i> of Nature, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				4.4.44
			</span></i>.</div>
